 <h3><u>Mai shaheed e raah e khuda hu</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Mai shaheed e raahe khuda hu</p> 
  <p>karam husain ka mujhpar mazeed hojaye<br> maru jo farsh e aza par to eid hojaye<br> ajeeb jazba hai har maa duae karti hai<br> khuda kare mera baccha shaheed hojaye</p> 
  <p>aai hai ek shaheed ki ye khuld se sadaa<br> mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>wajhe hayaat bangai mere liye qaza<br> mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>1. Labbaik ki uth ti thi har ek samt sadaen<br> khud maut mujhe deti thi jeene ki duaen<br> tazeem ko phir jhuk gai khud meri nigahen<br> phir murtuza ne mujhko gale se laga liya</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>2. Ye dars mujhe apni shahadat se mila hai<br> shabbir pe marne me hi jeene ka maza hai<br> ab taaba qayamat mera ghar karbobala hai<br> qatra tha apni zaat me darya se jaa mila</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>3. So jaan se qurbaan mili kaisi sa'adat<br> maujood thi baali pe meri shahe wilayat<br> us dam thi nigahe meri masroof e ziyarat<br> kab mera dum nikal gaya mujhko nahi pata</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>4. Masoom ke anwaar ka yu bangaya zaer<br> jaise kisi manzil pe pohoch jae musafir<br> ghaazi se mutahir ne kiya hai mujhe taahir<br> sab dhul gaye gunaah lahu jab mera baha</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>5. Turbat se andhero ka guzar ho nahi sakta<br> maujood hai masoom hai mahaul kisa ka<br> matam kabhi hota hai kabhi hota hai girya<br> mera mazaar sheh ka azakhana bangaya</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>6. Mai kaise bhula sakta hu ashoor e moharram<br> zakhmo se badan choor tha aur karb ka aalam<br> yaad aagai fitrus ki kahani mujhe us dum<br> daali nazar husain ne har zakhm bhar gaya</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>7. Aye dosto ho laakh mukhalif ye zamana<br> sar apna kabhi zulm ke aage na jhukana<br> 9 laakh bhi aajae to tum khauf na khana<br> meri tarah jo tum ko bhi deni hai ye sadaa</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>8. Ab meri aizza ke liye hai ye meri baat<br> jeeta to kaha hoti bhala meri ye auqaat<br> hai khuld me ghar hurr e dilawar ka mere saath<br> zarre se mujhko shaah ne suraj bana diya</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu</p> 
  <p>9. Paighaam takallum ye zamane ko suna do<br> rutba jo shaheedo ka hai duniya ko bata do<br> lau shauqe shahadat ki kuch is tarha badha do<br> jaa deke har husain ka aashiq ye de sadaa</p> 
  <p>mai.. khush naseeb hu<br> haa mai..khush naseeb hu<br> Mai shaheed e raah e khuda hu..(2)</p> 
